flowchart TD
    H["Hero: ordinary training on dedicated GPUs"] --> H
    H -. "Occasional consistent snapshot" .-> S["Initialize tied 1/8-cost draft"]
    S --> D["Draft trains for n steps on separate GPUs"]
    D --> U["Lift accumulated displacement into hero coordinates"]
    U --> B["At a hero step boundary: preserve current state"]
    H -. "Current weights and optimizer state" .-> B
    B --> V["Evaluate current and candidate weights on identical fresh data"]
    F["Calibrated ordinary-training loss forecast and uncertainty"] --> A
    V --> A{"Enough incremental progress for the cost?"}
    A -->|Yes| C["Commit candidate; apply explicit optimizer-state policy"]
    A -->|No| R["Discard candidate; retain original state"]
    C --> H
    R --> H
    C -. "Refresh draft; adapt horizon" .-> S
    R -. "Refresh draft; shorten horizon or scale" .-> S
